BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c6573ef3da26f969@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260730T211256Z
DTSTART:20260818T133000Z
DTEND:20260818T153000Z
SUMMARY:Stories of Co-Existence & Conservation from the North East
LOCATION:Gulmohar\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1350
DESCRIPTION:Stories of Co-Existence & Conservation from the North East . 
 Blurred Boundaries: The Mishmi and the Forest (Mishmi with English subtit
 les/13 mins) Dir. Imrana Khan . Vanishing Scavengers: Assam’s Vulture C
 onservation Efforts (English\, Hindi with English subtitles/4 mins) Dir. 
 Jahnu Baruah . Azuram Reserve: Manipur's Fight to Save Its Forest (Englis
 h\, Hindi with English subtitles/5 mins) Dir. Mordecai Panmei . Raimona N
 ational Park: Assam's Wildlife Sanctuary (English\, Assamese\, Boro with 
 English subtitles/8 mins) Dir. Arghadeep Barua . Chinese Pangolin: Manipu
 r's Fight to Save an Endangered Species (English\, Lianmai with English s
 ubtitles/6 mins) Dir. Mordecai Panmei . The Story of Peno: Protecting Aru
 nachal's Rich Biodiversity (Hindi with English subtitles/4 mins) Dir. Tal
 lo Anthony . World Cup Cicada: Meghalaya's Rare Forest Delicacy (Bhoi wit
 h English subtitles/4 mins) Dir. Thejavikho Chase . The Last Honey Hunter
 : Nagaland's Vanishing Cliffside Tradition (Wui with English subtitles/4 
 mins) Dir. Chentei Khiamniungan . Sikkim’s Indigenous Seed Keeper: Pres
 erving Lepcha Heritage (Lepcha with English subtitles/4 mins) Dir. Seela 
 Lepcha . Thangnang: Mizoram's Famous Stink Bug (Mizo with English subtitl
 es/4 mins) Dir. Thejavikho Chase . Bonaji: Tripura's Tribal Healing Tradi
 tions (Kokborok with English subtitles/2 mins) Dir. Karabi Jamatia . Ziro
 : The Land of Apatani People of Arunachal Pradesh (Apatani with English s
 ubtitles/5 mins) Dir. Pramod Saikia . Collab. Global Wildlife Fair . Foll
 owed by a discussion with Imrana Khan \, Dusty Foot Productions\; Mohit A
 ggarwal \, Global Wildlife Fair .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events_deta
 ils/1350
CATEGORIES:film\,cinema\,nature
END:VEVENT
